---
/** Placed in articles where talking to a lawyer is naturally the next step. Points to NACBA's public directory; GoBK has no referral relationship. */
---
<aside class="checkup-cta">
  <h2>Ready to talk to a lawyer about your situation?</h2>
  <p>NACBA, the national association of consumer bankruptcy attorneys, keeps a public directory of lawyers who represent people, not banks. Search by location; most offer a free first consultation.</p>
  <a href="https://network.nacba.org/network/advanced-search" class="btn btn-primary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Find a lawyer near you</a>
  <a href="/library/how-to-find-a-bankruptcy-attorney" class="guide">How to choose one</a>
</aside>
<style>
  .checkup-cta {
    background: var(--sage);
    color: #fff;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    margin: var(--space-5) 0;
    max-width: var(--measure);
  }
  .checkup-cta h2 { font-size: 1.5rem; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .checkup-cta p { color: #fff; margin: 0 0 var(--space-3); }
  .checkup-cta .btn-primary { background: #fff; color: var(--sage-deeper); border-color: #fff; }
  .checkup-cta .btn-primary:hover { background: var(--off); }
  .checkup-cta .guide { color: #fff; margin-left: 1.25rem; font-weight: 600; }
</style>
